second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which organization is Uee affiliated with?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 7, \"text\": \"**Uee**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 9, \"end\": 108, \"text\": \"Uee (Hangul: 유이) is a South Korean singer and actress born on April 9, 1989, in Daegu, South Korea.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 109, \"end\": 231, \"text\": \"She is best known as a member of the South Korean girl group After School and has also pursued a successful acting career.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 232, \"end\": 257, \"text\": \"**Early Life and Career**\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 259, \"end\": 305, \"text\": \"Uee was born Kim Yu-jin in Daegu, South Korea.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 306, \"end\": 418, \"text\": \"She debuted as a member of After School in 2009 and has since released several successful albums with the group.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 419, \"end\": 578, \"text\": \"In addition to her music career, Uee has also acted in various television dramas and films, including \\\"Queen Seondeok\\\", \\\"Ojakgyo Family\\\", and \\\"Golden Rainbow\\\".\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 579, \"end\": 618, \"text\": \"**Affiliation with Good Entertainment**\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 620, \"end\": 721, \"text\": \"Uee is currently affiliated with Good Entertainment, a South Korean entertainment management company.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 722, \"end\": 946, \"text\": \"According to various sources, including news articles and industry reports, Uee signed an exclusive contract with Good Entertainment in 2017, following her departure from Pledis Entertainment, her previous management agency.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 947, \"end\": 953, \"text\": \"[1][2]\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 955, \"end\": 1125, \"text\": \"Good Entertainment, founded in 2000, is a leading entertainment management company in South Korea, representing a range of artists, including actors, singers, and models.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1126, \"end\": 1281, \"text\": \"The company has a reputation for nurturing talented artists and providing them with opportunities for growth and development in the entertainment industry.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1282, \"end\": 1296, \"text\": \"**References**\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1298, \"end\": 1350, \"text\": \"[1] \\\"Uee signs with Good Entertainment\\\" (in Korean).\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1351, \"end\": 1358, \"text\": \"Newsen.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1359, \"end\": 1370, \"text\": \"2017-05-15.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1371, \"end\": 1392, \"text\": \"Retrieved 2022-02-20.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1393, \"end\": 1460, \"text\": \"[2] \\\"Uee joins Good Entertainment, starts new chapter\\\" (in Korean).\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1461, \"end\": 1466, \"text\": \"Osen.\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1467, \"end\": 1478, \"text\": \"2017-05-16.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1479, \"end\": 1500, \"text\": \"Retrieved 2022-02-20.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 54, \"text\": \"**Uee's Affiliation with the Smithsonian Institution**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 56, \"end\": 256, \"text\": \"Uee, a renowned South Korean singer and actress, has been affiliated with the prestigious Smithsonian Institution, a group of museums and research centers administered by the United States government.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 257, \"end\": 417, \"text\": \"This affiliation has been a subject of interest among fans and scholars alike, with several studies and events shedding light on the nature of this partnership.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 418, \"end\": 438, \"text\": \"**Early Beginnings**\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 440, \"end\": 618, \"text\": \"The seeds of Uee's affiliation with the Smithsonian Institution were sown in 2010, when she participated in a cultural exchange program between South Korea and the United States.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 619, \"end\": 802, \"text\": \"During this program, Uee engaged in a series of workshops and lectures at the Smithsonian's National Museum of Natural History, where she explored the intersection of art and science.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 803, \"end\": 829, \"text\": \"**Collaborative Research**\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 831, \"end\": 865, \"text\": \"In 2012, Uee collaborated with Dr.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 866, \"end\": 1045, \"text\": \"Sophia Patel, a renowned anthropologist at the Smithsonian's National Museum of Natural History, on a research project examining the role of K-pop in promoting cultural diplomacy.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1046, \"end\": 1239, \"text\": \"The study, titled \\\"K-Pop as Cultural Ambassador: A Case Study of Uee's Impact on International Relations,\\\" was published in the Journal of Cultural Anthropology and received widespread acclaim.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1240, \"end\": 1267, \"text\": \"**Performances and Events**\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1269, \"end\": 1462, \"text\": \"Uee has performed at several high-profile events hosted by the Smithsonian Institution, including the 2015 Smithsonian Folklife Festival, where she showcased traditional Korean music and dance.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1463, \"end\": 1638, \"text\": \"In 2018, she participated in a special concert at the National Museum of American History, celebrating the 50th anniversary of the Smithsonian's Asian Pacific American Center.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1639, \"end\": 1670, \"text\": \"**Exhibitions and Collections**\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1672, \"end\": 1810, \"text\": \"The Smithsonian Institution has also recognized Uee's contributions to the world of music and art by featuring her in several exhibitions.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1811, \"end\": 2002, \"text\": \"In 2019, the National Museum of Asian Pacific American History and Culture launched an exhibit titled \\\"K-Pop: A Global Phenomenon,\\\" which included artifacts and memorabilia from Uee's career.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2003, \"end\": 2222, \"text\": \"Additionally, the Smithsonian's National Museum of American History has acquired several items from Uee's personal collection, including costumes and stage props, which are now part of the museum's permanent collection.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2223, \"end\": 2237, \"text\": \"**References**\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2239, \"end\": 2250, \"text\": \"* Patel, S.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2251, \"end\": 2258, \"text\": \"(2012).\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2259, \"end\": 2345, \"text\": \"K-Pop as Cultural Ambassador: A Case Study of Uee's Impact on International Relations.\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2346, \"end\": 2395, \"text\": \"Journal of Cultural Anthropology, 27(3), 345-362.\"}, \"D2S23\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2396, \"end\": 2422, \"text\": \"* Smithsonian Institution.\"}, \"D2S24\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2423, \"end\": 2430, \"text\": \"(2015).\"}, \"D2S25\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2431, \"end\": 2469, \"text\": \"Smithsonian Folklife Festival Program.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Uee\", \"scope\": \"current\", \"claim\": \"Uee is currently affiliated with Good Entertainment.\", \"answer\": \"Good Entertainment\", \"quote\": \"Uee is currently affiliated with Good Entertainment, a South Korean entertainment management company. According to various sources, including news articles and industry reports, Uee signed an exclusive contract with Good Entertainment in 2017, following her departure from Pledis Entertainment, her previous management agency.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Good Entertainment\", \"Smithsonian Institution\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Good Entertainment\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Smithsonian Institution\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
